{"id":"n82890-1-11","stage":2,"title":"퇴직 · 退休","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82890-1-11-1","ko":"왜 퇴직을 하려는 거야?","zh":"为什么想要辞职啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"퇴직을","meaning":"退休，退职","explanation":"퇴직：退休，退职；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"퇴직","audio":"/audio/de9bb00b52a1187296a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82890","senseId":"1","lemma":"퇴직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"퇴직을","audio":"/audio/f886dbf37de88a80eb61.mp3"}},{"text":"하려는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려는：表示正打算或意图做某事，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하려는","audio":"/audio/2b6e5a22b0648e8c3223.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"de9bb00b52a11872","term":"퇴직","zh":"退休，退职","audio":"/audio/de9bb00b52a1187296a7.mp3","entryId":"82890","definition":"从现在的职业或岗位上退出。","pronunciation":["퇴ː직","퉤ː직"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"